pmc:NewThoughtShinnScatteringYourForces a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Talking about one's affairs scatters one's forces"@en, "Reden über eigene Angelegenheiten zerstreut die Kräfte"@de ;
    skos:definition "Discussing hopes, fears and failures at length, e.g. with family each evening, is said to scatter forces and bring one up against a high wall."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnSecretDoorOfSuccess fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
