pmc:NewThoughtShinnWallOfDiscouragement a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Discouragement and giving up just before the good arrives"@en, "Entmutigung und Aufgeben kurz vor dem Eintreffen des Guten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Discouragement is a wall; a program seller is quoted that most people quit right before something big comes to them."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnSecretDoorOfSuccess fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
