    rdfs:label "Refusing to be discouraged; never giving up yields expansion into a liked new job"@en, "Sich nicht entmutigen lassen; nie aufgeben: Wechsel in eine neue, geliebte Stelle"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, student or acquaintance: refusing to be discouraged; never giving up was followed by expansion into a liked new job."@en ;
