pmc:NewThoughtShinnStraightAndNarrowPath a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Road to success as straight path of undivided attention"@en, "Weg zum Erfolg als gerader Pfad ungeteilter Aufmerksamkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Drawing on Joshua (where the word success is said to occur only twice in the Bible), the road to success is one of loving absorption and undivided attention, turning neither right nor left."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
