pmc:NewThoughtShinnFolkLoreFoundedOnTruth a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Folklore and fairy tales as legends founded on Truth"@en, "Volksgut und Märchen als in der Wahrheit gegründete Legenden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fairy stories descend from legends grounded in Truth and carry the same idea: a spoken word makes a door open or splits a rock; Ali Baba's Open Sesame is read so: one's barriers part at the right word."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 1 \"The Secret Door to Success\", p. 155; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnWallsOfLackAndDelayYieldsWordDissolvesObstacles a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Walls-of-lack-and-delay affirmation yields power of the word to dissolve obstacles"@en, "Affirmation: Die Mauern von Mangel und Verzögerung zerfallen, ich betrete mein Gelobtes Land in Gnade: Macht des Wortes, Hindernisse aufzulösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that walls-of-lack-and-delay affirmation brings about power of the word to dissolve obstacles."@en ;
    skos:note "The chapter closes by prescribing the walls-of-lack statement as the right word that parts barriers."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWallsOfLackAndDelay ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnWordDissolvesObstacles ;
