pmc:NewThoughtShinnDoubtsAndFearsKeepYouInSlavery a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Doubts and fears keep one in slavery"@en, "Zweifel und Ängste halten in der Sklaverei"@de ;
    skos:definition "One's doubts and fears are what keep one in bondage and make situations look hopeless."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnLifeFreeFromAllLimitation fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
