pmc:NewThoughtShinnGameOfSolitaire a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Life as solitaire: conditions change as you change"@en, "Das Leben ist eine Patience: Wenn du dich änderst, ändern sich die Umstände"@de ;
    skos:definition "No one gives to or takes from a man but himself; conditions change as the person changes."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 2 \"Bricks Without Straw\", p. 161; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

