pmc:NewThoughtShinnWhatGodHasDoneForOthersAffirmationYieldsSuddenChequeOrGift a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Affirmation claiming for oneself, and more, the blessings God gave others yields sudden receipt of a cheque or gift"@en, "Affirmation: Was Gott für andere tat, tut er nun für mich und mehr: Plötzlicher Erhalt eines Schecks oder Geschenks"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that affirmation claiming for oneself, and more, the blessings God gave others brings about sudden receipt of a cheque or gift."@en ;
