pmp:NewThoughtShinnFindingTheKingPin a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Finding and straightening one's king-pin thought"@en, "Den eigenen Schlüsselgedanken (king-pin) finden und geraderichten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Identify the thought that is one's chief oppressor (there may be several), like the log that jams a river, and straighten it out; resentment is a common one."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"king-pin\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
