pmc:NewThoughtShinnLogsOfSuccess a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Free flow of success, happiness and abundance"@en, "Freier Fluss von Erfolg, Glück und Fülle"@de ;
    skos:definition "Once the king-pin is found, success, happiness and abundance are said to flow like freed logs down a river."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
