    rdfs:label "Finding and straightening one's king-pin thought yields free flow of success, happiness and abundance"@en, "Den eigenen Schlüsselgedanken (king-pin) finden und geraderichten: Freier Fluss von Erfolg, Glück und Fülle"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that finding and straightening one's king-pin thought brings about free flow of success, happiness and abundance."@en ;
