    rdfs:label "Merging with what one notices"@en, "Man verbindet sich mit dem, was man bemerkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "What one habitually notices one merges with; noticing failure and hard times brings them. Reused in Ch. 4 for noticing beautiful things."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"You combine with what you notice\"."@en ;
