pmp:NewThoughtShinnLivingInTheFourthDimension a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Living in the fourth dimension, not judging by appearances"@en, "Leben in der vierten Dimension, nicht nach dem Schein urteilen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Form the habit of dwelling in the wondrous world where appearances do not decide one's judgment, schooling the inner eye to look past failure, sickness and limitation to success, health and plenty."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"The World of the Wondrous; fourth dimension\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
