pmc:NewThoughtShinnFixedIdeaOfSuccess a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Fixed idea of success; only divine ideas endure"@en, "Feste Erfolgsidee; nur göttliche Ideen bestehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The successful man holds a fixed idea of success; if grounded in truth and rightness it stands, otherwise it is washed away; evil destroys itself as a cross-current to universal order."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
