pmc:NewThoughtShinnFoundedOnARockOfTruth a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Success not founded on truth and rightness will not stand"@en, "Erfolg ohne Grund in Wahrheit und Recht hat keinen Bestand"@de ;
    skos:definition "An idea of success built on sand returns to nothingness; the transgressor's way is hard."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnSecretDoorOfSuccess ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
