pmc:NewThoughtShinnLivingInTheFourthDimensionYieldsInnerEyeSeesThrough a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Living in the fourth dimension, not judging by appearances yields trained inner eye that sees through appearances"@en, "Leben in der vierten Dimension, nicht nach dem Schein urteilen: Geschultes inneres Auge, das durch den Schein sieht"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that living in the fourth dimension, not judging by appearances brings about trained inner eye that sees through appearances."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLivingInTheFourthDimension ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnInnerEyeSeesThrough ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
