pmc:NewThoughtShinnDivineIdeaIsPlenty a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Plenty is God's idea for every man; one must ask aright"@en, "Die göttliche Idee für jeden ist Fülle; man muss richtig bitten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Barns should be full and cups overflowing, but the request must be framed correctly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 3 \"And Five of Them Were Wise\", p. 168; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnLawOfAccumulation a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Law-of-accumulation affirmation"@en, "Affirmation: Ich rufe das Gesetz der Anhäufung an"@de ;
    skos:definition "State that one invokes the law of accumulation and that one's God-given supply is now flowing in and piling up under grace; framed to evoke no image of stint, saving or sickness."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"law of accumulation\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 3 \"And Five of Them Were Wise\", p. 168; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnFourthDimensionalFeelingOfAbundance a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Fourth-dimensional feeling of abundance"@en, "Vierdimensionales Gefühl der Fülle"@de ;
    skos:definition "The statement is said to give a feeling of abundance from the fourth dimension while the choice of channels is left to Infinite Intelligence."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
