pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfAccumulationYieldsFourthDimensionalFeelingOfAbundance a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Law-of-accumulation affirmation yields fourth-dimensional feeling of abundance"@en, "Affirmation: Ich rufe das Gesetz der Anhäufung an: Vierdimensionales Gefühl der Fülle"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that law-of-accumulation affirmation brings about fourth-dimensional feeling of abundance."@en ;
