    rdfs:label "the affirmation of the never-empty purse of Spirit yields drawing on the imagination as a bank"@en, "Affirmation der nie leeren Börse des Geistes: Schöpfen aus der Bank der Vorstellungskraft"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that the affirmation of the never-empty purse of Spirit brings about drawing on the imagination as a bank."@en ;
