pmc:NewThoughtShinnFearlesslyPaidHerBills a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Fearless paying of bills followed by unexpected cheques"@en, "Furchtloses Bezahlen von Rechnungen, gefolgt von unerwarteten Schecks"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman afraid to see her account shrink took the statement with conviction, paid her bills without fear, and received several unexpected large cheques."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
