pmp:NewThoughtShinnLampsFilledWithTheOilOfFaith a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Closing affirmation of lamps full of faith's oil"@en, "Schlussaffirmation: Meine Lampen sind mit dem Öl des Glaubens gefüllt"@de ;
    skos:definition "State that one's lamps are now full of faith's oil and of fulfillment."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"My lamps are now filled with the oil of faith\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
