    rdfs:label "Changing one's expectancies by acting as if success were expected yields changing one's conditions"@en, "Die Erwartungen ändern, indem man handelt, als erwarte man Erfolg: Die eigenen Umstände verändern"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that changing one's expectancies by acting as if success were expected brings about changing one's conditions."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnChangeYourExpectancies ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnChangeYourConditions ;
