pmc:NewThoughtShinnChangeYourExpectanciesYieldsImpressTheSubconscious a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Changing one's expectancies by acting as if success were expected yields impressing the subconscious"@en, "Die Erwartungen ändern, indem man handelt, als erwarte man Erfolg: Das Unterbewusstsein beeindrucken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that changing one's expectancies by acting as if success were expected brings about impressing the subconscious."@en ;
