pmc:NewThoughtShinnGiantSwingIntoFaithYieldsTheRightManCame a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Symbolic purchase as a giant leap into faith yields arrival of the right partner"@en, "Durch einen symbolischen Kauf den großen Sprung in den Glauben wagen: Ankunft des richtigen Partners"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, student or acquaintance: symbolic purchase as a giant leap into faith was followed by arrival of the right partner."@en ;
