pmp:NewThoughtShinnSeeGodInEveryFace a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Seeing God in every person and good in all situations"@en, "Gott in jedem Gesicht und das Gute in jeder Lage sehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Realize every blessing as God in action and look for God in every person and good in every circumstance."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnISeeGodInEveryFace (Your Word Is Your Wand, p. 63): there this way of seeing is the promise of an affirmation for the eyes; here it is the practice, and its yield is mastery of all conditions."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 4 \"What Do You Expect?\", p. 173; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnMasterOfAllConditions a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Mastery of all conditions"@en, "Herrschaft über alle Umstände"@de ;
    skos:definition "Seeing God and good everywhere is said to make one master of every condition."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
