pmp:NewThoughtShinnGodIsYourLandlord a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Realizing that God is one's landlord"@en, "Erkennen, dass Gott der eigene Vermieter ist"@de ;
    skos:definition "Recognize the person controlling a situation as God in manifestation; the author told a woman without heating that God was her landlord."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"God is your landlord\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:firstPersonReport ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 4 \"What Do You Expect?\", p. 173; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnHeatTurnedOnWithoutAsking a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Situation resolved without asking"@en, "Lösung der Lage ohne Bitte"@de ;
    skos:definition "That evening the heat came on unasked, because she realized that God was manifest in the landlord."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
