pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfForgivenessYieldsFreeFromMistakes a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Calling on the law of forgiveness yields freedom from mistakes and their consequences"@en, "Das Gesetz der Vergebung anrufen: Freiheit von Fehlern und ihren Folgen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that calling on the law of forgiveness brings about freedom from mistakes and their consequences."@en ;
