pmc:NewThoughtShinnBodyElectricExpressedPresupposesFreeFromMistakes a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Forgiveness before the body electric"@en, "Vergebung vor dem elektrischen Leib"@de ;
    skos:definition "The body electric is presented as following (then) the freedom gained through the law of forgiveness."@en ;
