    rdfs:label "Closing affirmation of expecting the unexpected yields manifestation of what is prayed for"@en, "Schlussaffirmation: Ich erwarte das Unerwartete, mein herrliches Gutes verwirklicht sich: Manifestation des Erbetenen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that closing affirmation of expecting the unexpected brings about manifestation of what is prayed for."@en ;
