pmc:NewThoughtShinnNonResistanceIsAnArt a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Non-resistance as an acquired art"@en, "Nicht-Widerstand als erworbene Kunst"@de ;
    skos:definition "Non-resistance is called an art which, once acquired, gives one the world."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Non-resistance is an art\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfNonresistance (The Game of Life, p. 30): there nonresistance is a law grounded in evil having no reality; here it is an art one acquires, after which the world is said to be one's own."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
