pmc:NewThoughtShinnFortuneSeekethThee a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Seek nothing; fortune seeks you"@en, "Suche nichts; das Glück sucht dich"@de ;
    skos:definition "A verse of unknown authorship is cited: flee what flees, seek nothing, and fortune comes to the door."@en ;
