pmc:NewThoughtShinnRestInAction a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Rest in action (relaxed speed and endurance)"@en, "Ruhe im Tun (entspannte Schnelligkeit und Ausdauer)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lovelock was most relaxed when running fastest; the hearers are invited to attain the same rest in action."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
