pmp:NewThoughtShinnTakingTheClutchOff a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Letting go, taking the clutch off"@en, "Loslassen, die Kupplung lösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Release one's grip on the desire long enough for the law of attraction to act, like a magnet that stands calm because needles must come to it."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"taken the clutch off\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
