    rdfs:label "Do not let the heart's desire become the heart's disease"@en, "Den Herzenswunsch nicht zur Herzenskrankheit werden lassen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Quoted from the author's correspondence course: desiring something too intensely demagnetizes one; one worries, fears and agonizes."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"heart's desire become your heart's disease\"."@en ;
