    rdfs:label "Demagnetized by over-intense desire"@en, "Entmagnetisiert durch zu heftiges Wünschen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Failure condition: wanting something too intensely, with worry and agonizing, is said to demagnetize one completely."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"demagnetized\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnRighteousDesire fails."@en ;
