    rdfs:label "The occult law of indifference"@en, "Das okkulte Gesetz der Gleichgültigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "Being unmoved by things lets one's ships arrive over a sea of not caring; in Ch. 8 it means being undisturbed by adverse appearances and holding the constructive thought, which wins."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"occult law of indifference\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
