    skos:note "Differs from pmp:NewThoughtShinnDefiniteLead (The Game of Life, p. 66): there the lead is demanded after the word is spoken and before anything is done; here asking for an unmistakable lead is how one decides at a fork, and a stranded student prays for one."@en ;
