pmp:NewThoughtShinnStrongEastWind a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Strong affirmation as the east wind: big happy financial surprises"@en, "Starke Affirmation als Ostwind: große glückliche finanzielle Überraschungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "For a financial problem, state that one's supply is from God and that big, happy money surprises arrive in perfect ways under grace; it is a good statement because it holds an element of mystery."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"strong east wind; big happy financial surprises\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
