pmc:NewThoughtShinnEastWindBlows a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Causing the east wind to blow (parting the sea of lack)"@en, "Den Ostwind wehen lassen (das Meer des Mangels teilen)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Having made the statement for supply one is said to have set the dividing wind in motion."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
