    rdfs:label "Walking up to one's Red Sea: doing something to show fearlessness"@en, "Auf das eigene Rote Meer zugehen: etwas tun, das Furchtlosigkeit zeigt"@de ;
    skos:definition "After the statement, act fearlessly toward the lack, e.g. follow the hunch to go to the event though lacking the means."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
