pmc:NewThoughtShinnWalkUpToYourRedSeaPresupposesStrongEastWind a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Statement first, then fearless action"@en, "Erst die Aussage, dann furchtloses Handeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Once the statement has made the east wind blow, one then walks up to the Red Sea by fearless action."@en ;
