#
# The Watchman at the Gate
#

pmc:NewThoughtShinnWatchmanAtTheGate a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "The Watchman at the Gate = the superconscious mind"@en, "Der Wächter am Tor = das Überbewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "The watchman over one's thoughts is the superconscious mind; it never slumbers, is the eye that watches over Israel, the third eye or single eye."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "Watchman at the Gate; Eye which watches over Israel; third eye" ;
    pm:nameRole "superconscious mind guarding the gate of thought" ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 196; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnPowerToChooseOurThoughts a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Power to choose one's thoughts"@en, "Die Macht, die eigenen Gedanken zu wählen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Humans are said to have the power to choose their thoughts, though millennia of race thought make control seem almost impossible."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 196; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnRaceThought a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "Race thought"@en, "Rassengedanke (Kollektivdenken)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Collective thought of mankind lived in for thousands of years, making thoughts stampede and insisting one must worry about something."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "race thought; race-thought; world thought" ;
    pm:nameRole "collective negative mentality" ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
