pmp:NewThoughtShinnGentleDetermination a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Controlling thoughts by gentle determination: continual repetition of an affirmation"@en, "Gedanken mit sanfter Entschlossenheit lenken: fortwährende Wiederholung einer Affirmation"@de ;
    skos:definition "Like a sheep-dog sitting and staring until the sheep go in, use gentle determination, not force: keep repeating one affirmation while the thoughts rampage."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
