pmc:NewThoughtShinnMasterOfTheSituation a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Control of thoughts; mastery of the situation"@en, "Beherrschung der Gedanken; Herr der Lage"@de ;
    skos:definition "Though thoughts cannot always be controlled, words can; repetition impresses the subconscious and one becomes master of the situation."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
