    rdfs:label "Controlling words before controlling thoughts"@en, "Erst die Worte beherrschen, dann die Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Since thoughts cannot always be controlled but words can, word repetition is placed first; impressing the subconscious follows and then mastery."@en ;
