pmc:NewThoughtShinnThoughtsCrystallize a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Thoughts crystallize on the external"@en, "Gedanken kristallisieren im Äußeren"@de ;
    skos:definition "Success and happiness depend on the watchman over thoughts, since thoughts sooner or later take form outwardly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
