pmc:NewThoughtShinnWizardOfOz a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The Wizard of Oz read metaphysically"@en, "Der Zauberer von Oz metaphysisch gelesen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Dorothy meets the same mean woman as a witch in Oz; the companions find they already had brain, heart and courage gained through experience; the heart's desire is at home."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
