pmp:NewThoughtShinnBeUndisturbed a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Remaining undisturbed by a situation"@en, "Unbeirrt bleiben von einer Lage"@de ;
    skos:definition "Let the situation not disturb one (modern form of the law of indifference)."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnUndisturbedByAdverseAppearances (Your Word Is Your Wand, p. 23): there being unmoved is a state promised by an affirmation; here it is the practice, after which the situation drops away."@en ;
