    rdfs:label "Remaining undisturbed by a situation yields dissolving an obstacle by fearlessness"@en, "Unbeirrt bleiben von einer Lage: Hindernisauflösung durch Furchtlosigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that remaining undisturbed by a situation brings about dissolving an obstacle by fearlessness."@en ;
