    rdfs:label "Redeeming the world by seeing the perfect plan"@en, "Die Welt erlösen durch das Schauen des vollkommenen Plans"@de ;
    skos:definition "By clearly seeing the perfect plan with the inner eye, a world of peace, plenty and goodwill, we could redeem the world."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    skos:note "Stated as a possibility (could), not as a promise."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
