    rdfs:label "Healer's attitude: unmoved by appearances of lack, loss or illness"@en, "Haltung des Heilers: Gleichgültigkeit gegenüber dem Anschein von Mangel, Verlust oder Krankheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The healer or practitioner holds the attitude of indifference to adverse appearances toward the patient."@en ;
