    rdfs:label "Bringing about change in a patient's mind, body and affairs"@en, "Veränderung in Geist, Körper und Angelegenheiten eines Patienten bewirken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The practitioner indifferent to appearances is said to effect the change."@en ;
