    rdfs:label "Only occasional flashes of intuition, then relapse into chaos"@en, "Nur gelegentliche Blitze der Intuition, dann Rückfall ins Chaos"@de ;
    skos:definition "One living in negative thought is unconscious of the inner eye; flashes of intuition or illumination come and he falls back."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnMagicPathOfIntuition fails."@en ;
