pmc:NewThoughtShinnEternalVigilanceOverWords a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Determination and eternal vigilance are needed over words and thoughts"@en, "Entschlossenheit und ewige Wachsamkeit über Worte und Gedanken sind nötig"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fearful, failing, resentful and ill-willed thoughts have to be dissolved; checking them needs constant vigilance."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnPowerToChooseOurThoughts ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 201; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnChangeInMindBodyAndAffairsPresupposesHealersAttitude a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Indifference to appearances as required attitude of the healer"@en, "Gleichgültigkeit gegenüber dem Anschein als notwendige Haltung des Heilers"@de ;
    skos:definition "The healer is required to hold this attitude; no consequence of lacking it is stated."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnChangeInMindBodyAndAffairs ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnHealersAttitude ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
