pmc:NewThoughtShinnHealersAttitudeYieldsChangeInMindBodyAndAffairs a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Healer's attitude: unmoved by appearances of lack, loss or illness yields bringing about change in a patient's mind, body and affairs"@en, "Haltung des Heilers: Gleichgültigkeit gegenüber dem Anschein von Mangel, Verlust oder Krankheit: Veränderung in Geist, Körper und Angelegenheiten eines Patienten bewirken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that healer's attitude: unmoved by appearances of lack, loss or illness brings about bringing about change in a patient's mind, body and affairs."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnHealersAttitude ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnChangeInMindBodyAndAffairs ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 201; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnEveryPlantShallBeRootedUp a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Statement: every plant not planted by my Father shall be rooted up"@en, "Aussage: Jede Pflanze, die mein Vater nicht gepflanzt hat, wird ausgerissen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Speak the scriptural statement and picture pulling weeds from a garden which dry up without soil."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 202; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnNegativeThoughtsRootedUp a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Dissolving negative thoughts"@en, "Auflösen negativer Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Negative thoughts of fear, failure and ill-will are dissolved and dissipated, like uprooted weeds drying."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
