pmc:NewThoughtShinnYouNourishNegativeThoughts a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Attention nourishes negative thoughts"@en, "Aufmerksamkeit nährt negative Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "One feeds negative thoughts by giving them attention."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 202; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnStarveOutTheArmyOfAliens a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Starving out the army of aliens; desiring only what God desires through one"@en, "Das Heer der Fremden aushungern; nur wünschen, was Gott durch einen wünscht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Refusing interest starves negative thought; divine ideas crowd consciousness, false ones fade, and one desires only what God desires through one."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnNegativeThoughtsStarveOnFaith (Your Word Is Your Wand, p. 43): there negative thoughts starve on faith; here they starve because attention is withdrawn from them under the law of indifference."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 8 \"The Watchman at the Gate\", p. 202; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnLeaveThePlanToTheDivineDesigner a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Leaving the plan of one's life to the Divine Designer"@en, "Den Plan des eigenen Lebens dem Göttlichen Gestalter überlassen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Do not design one's life oneself; leave it to the divine plan."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
