    rdfs:label "Closing holy-ground affirmation"@en, "Schlussaffirmation: Der Boden, auf dem ich stehe, ist heiliger Boden"@de ;
    skos:definition "State that one stands on holy ground and is now expanding quickly into one's life's divine plan, where all conditions remain perfect forever."@en ;
