pmc:NewThoughtShinnPraiseAndThanksgivingYieldsPraiseOpensTheGates a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Seeking with praise and thanksgiving instead of desperately yields Opening the gates (expectancy wins)"@en, "Mit Lob und Dank suchen statt verzweifelt: Öffnen der Tore (Erwartung siegt)"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that seeking with praise and thanksgiving instead of desperately brings about Opening the gates (expectancy wins)."@en ;
