pmc:NewThoughtShinnThingIllGot a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "The law is impersonal: ill-got riches do not last"@en, "Das Gesetz ist unpersönlich: unrecht Erworbenes hat keinen Bestand"@de ;
    skos:definition "A dishonest person who thinks richly will draw riches, but they are short-lived and bring no happiness (Shakespeare cited)."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnPerfectWay ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
