pmc:NewThoughtShinnUniversalSupply a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "The Universal Supply"@en, "Der universelle Vorrat"@de ;
    skos:definition "An impersonal source on which demands are made; in the superconscious there is lavish supply for every demand."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "Universal Supply" ;
    pm:nameRole "impersonal source of all supply" ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 205; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnCannotHoldProsperity a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Attracting prosperity but not holding it"@en, "Wohlstand anziehen, aber nicht halten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Some lose it through turned heads or fear and worry; a family who struck oil shifted their worry to health after the father died on the golf links and took to bed with nurses."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnWayOfAbundance fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 205; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousness a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Rich consciousness"@en, "Reiches Bewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "A mental state attuned to abundance that taps the lavish divinely planned supply."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 206; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnYouCantHaveEverything a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Overcoming world thought: you can have everything"@en, "Das Weltdenken überwinden: man kann alles haben"@de ;
    skos:definition "The old belief that gaining one thing loses another, or that luck will not last, is world thought, which Jesus overcame."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 206; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnReturnToTheAlmighty a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Return to God in consciousness brings opulence"@en, "Die Rückkehr zum Allmächtigen im Bewusstsein bringt Überfluss"@de ;
    skos:definition "Job 22 is read as: returning to God in consciousness builds one up so that one lays up gold as dust."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 206; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousnessIsDifficult a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Building a rich consciousness is very difficult after long lack-thinking"@en, "Ein reiches Bewusstsein aufzubauen ist nach langem Mangeldenken sehr schwer"@de ;
    skos:definition "For the average person who has long thought in terms of lack it is hard to build a rich consciousness."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousness ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
