pmp:NewThoughtShinnDaughterOfTheKing a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "King's-daughter affirmation"@en, "Affirmation: Ich bin die Tochter des Königs"@de ;
    skos:definition "State that one is the King's child, that one's rich Father now pours out abundance and everything makes way."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"I am the daughter of the King\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 9 \"The Way of Abundance\", p. 206; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnMentallyLazy a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Mental laziness keeps people in limited conditions"@en, "Geistige Trägheit hält in begrenzten Umständen fest"@de ;
    skos:definition "Many tolerate limitation because they are mentally too lazy to think their way out."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousness fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
