pmc:NewThoughtShinnDaughterOfTheKingYieldsRichConsciousness a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "King's-daughter affirmation yields rich consciousness"@en, "Affirmation: Ich bin die Tochter des Königs: Reiches Bewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, student or acquaintance: King's-daughter affirmation was followed by rich consciousness."@en ;
    skos:note "A student is said to have attracted great success by it."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnDaughterOfTheKing ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousness ;
