pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousnessPresupposesMakingBelieve a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Desire, feeling and seeing oneself rich, continual preparation"@en, "Verlangen, sich reich fühlen und sehen, beständige Vorbereitung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Listed as musts for financial freedom; no consequence of omission is stated."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichesPresupposeConsciousness (The Game of Life, p. 44): there one must be rich in consciousness before riches come; here the order runs one step earlier, from make-believe and preparation to the rich consciousness itself."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnRichConsciousness ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnMakingBelieve ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
