pmc:NewThoughtShinnRealmOfPerfectIdeasAgain a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The superconscious as realm of perfect ideas from which genius draws"@en, "Das Überbewusstsein als Reich der vollkommenen Ideen, aus dem das Genie schöpft"@de ;
    skos:definition "The superconscious is the sphere of inspiration, of revelation and illumination, and of intuition (commonly called a hunch), and holds perfect ideas, from which great geniuses take their thoughts."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"hunch\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
