pmc:NewThoughtShinnPowerToImageLost a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Losing the power to image one's good"@en, "Die Kraft verlieren, sich das eigene Gute vorzustellen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Reading vision as imagination: people who lose the power to picture their good perish or go under."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnImagingFaculty fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
