pmc:NewThoughtShinnFrenchBible a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "French Bible reading of Job 22: cast away gold, God is your gold"@en, "Lesart der französischen Bibel: Wirf das Gold in den Staub, der Allmächtige sei dein Gold"@de ;
    skos:definition "Comparing translations of Job 22, the author takes the French version to mean that one relying wholly on visible supply would do better to discard it and trust the Almighty absolutely."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
