pmc:NewThoughtShinnMakingBelieveYieldsImpressTheSubconscious a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Making believe one is rich yields impressing the subconscious"@en, "So tun, als sei man reich: Das Unterbewusstsein beeindrucken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that making believe one is rich brings about impressing the subconscious."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnMakingBelieve ;
