pmp:NewThoughtShinnRelyEntirelyUponGod a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Relying entirely on God rather than visible supply"@en, "Sich ganz auf Gott statt auf sichtbaren Vorrat verlassen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Give up dependence on the visible means and trust God absolutely for supply; in a told story a priest threw a nunnery's last coin out of the window and told the nun to rely entirely on God."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
