pmc:NewThoughtShinnDontDependUponIt a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Do not throw your money away, but do not depend on it"@en, "Wirf dein Geld nicht weg, aber verlass dich nicht darauf"@de ;
    skos:definition "Self-qualification of the French-Bible lesson: keep one's money, but depend on the invisible supply, the imagination's bank; similarly bank accounts are allowed but not to be relied on (Ch. 10)."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnRelyEntirelyUponGod ;
