    rdfs:label "Attaching oneself to God to have peace yields swinging into the way of abundance"@en, "Sich an Gott binden, um Frieden zu haben: In den Weg der Fülle einschwingen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that attaching oneself to God to have peace brings about swinging into the way of abundance."@en ;
