pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheLordIsMyShepherdYieldsAbundanceOfTheSpheres a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Shepherd affirmation (Psalm 23) yields never wanting: every need met, drawing at once from the spheres' abundance"@en, "Affirmation: Der Herr ist mein Hirte, mir wird nichts mangeln: Nie Mangel leiden: jedes Bedürfnis gedeckt, sofortiges Schöpfen aus der Fülle der Sphären"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that Shepherd affirmation (Psalm 23) brings about never wanting: every need met, drawing at once from the spheres' abundance."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnTheLordIsMyShepherd ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnAbundanceOfTheSpheres ;
