    rdfs:label "Contacting invisible supply by a statement that clicks yields touching one's invisible supply; feeling outside time and space"@en, "Kontakt zum unsichtbaren Vorrat durch eine einrastende Aussage: Den unsichtbaren Vorrat berühren; sich außerhalb von Zeit und Raum fühlen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that contacting invisible supply by a statement that clicks brings about touching one's invisible supply; feeling outside time and space."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnStatementWhichClicksForSupply ;
