pmc:NewThoughtShinnShortCircuit a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Short circuit caused by intellect and personal will"@en, "Verstand und Eigenwille verursachen einen Kurzschluss"@de ;
    skos:definition "Interference by the reasoning mind and the personal will short-circuits the supply."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnAbundanceOfTheSpheres fails."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnReasoningMind (The Game of Life, p. 49): there directing the subconscious from reason makes little headway; here reason and personal will short-circuit the contact with the Creative Principle."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 10 \"I Shall Never Want\", p. 212; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnRelyingOnCertainConditions a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Relying on certain conditions and lacking imagination for new channels"@en, "Sich auf bestimmte Umstände verlassen und keine Vorstellungskraft für neue Kanäle haben"@de ;
    skos:definition "A businessman who runs his affairs on Truth methods is quoted: most people come to rely on particular conditions and lack the imagination to open new channels; apprehension arises when nothing outer is left to cling to."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnAbundanceOfTheSpheres fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
