pmc:NewThoughtShinnSpeakTheWordPresupposesFaith a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Faith in the treatment for it to work"@en, "Glaube an die Behandlung, damit sie wirkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "The treatment works only with faith; skipping it, the treatment will not help."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnDemonstrationPresupposesFaith (The Game of Life, p. 46): there faith comes before an inexhaustible supply; here faith in the treatment itself is required, and without it the treatment does not help."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpeakTheWord ;
    pm:priorStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnFaith ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "The treatment will not help." ;
