pmc:NewThoughtShinnConvincedYouAreAFailure a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Being convinced one is a failure"@en, "Überzeugt sein, ein Versager zu sein"@de ;
    skos:definition "One stays a failure until the subconscious is impressed with the conviction of success, done by an affirmation that clicks."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnImpressTheSubconscious fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
