pmc:NewThoughtShinnHappySurprises a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Good things and happy surprises beginning to come"@en, "Gute Dinge und glückliche Überraschungen beginnen zu kommen"@de ;
    skos:definition "After the statement clicked, good things and happy surprises immediately started to arrive for her."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
