pmc:NewThoughtShinnRepetitionImpressesTheSubconscious a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Why affirmations are necessary: repetition impresses the subconscious"@en, "Warum Affirmationen nötig sind: Wiederholung prägt das Unterbewusstsein"@de ;
    skos:definition "At first one cannot control thoughts but can control words; by one's words one is justified or condemned; hence one chooses right words and thoughts daily."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
