pmp:NewThoughtShinnImagineOurselvesRich a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Imagining oneself rich, well and happy while leaving the way to Infinite Intelligence"@en, "Sich reich, gesund und glücklich vorstellen und den Weg der Unendlichen Intelligenz überlassen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Draw on the imagination's bank: imagine oneself rich, well and happy and all affairs in divine order, without prescribing how fulfillment comes."@en ;
