    rdfs:label "Ingenious-ways affirmation yields a series of unexpected contacts producing the desired situation"@en, "Affirmation: Gottes Wege sind genial, seine Methoden sicher: Eine Reihe unerwarteter Kontakte, die die ersehnte Lage herbeiführen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, student or acquaintance: ingenious-ways affirmation was followed by a series of unexpected contacts producing the desired situation."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnGodsWaysAreIngenious ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnUnexpectedContacts ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
