pmc:NewThoughtShinnReceivedOnTheInvisiblePlaneYieldsStepsLeadingUpToItSecured a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Thanks for receipt on the invisible plane yields the steps leading to the good secured"@en, "Dank für den Empfang auf der unsichtbaren Ebene: Die zum Guten führenden Schritte gesichert"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that thanks for receipt on the invisible plane brings about the steps leading to the good secured."@en ;
