pmc:NewThoughtShinnWakeUpToYourLeadsYieldsMyPromisedLand a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Waking up to one's leads and hunches yields finding oneself in one's Promised Land"@en, "Für die eigenen Hinweise und Ahnungen aufwachen: Sich im eigenen Gelobten Land finden"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that waking up to one's leads and hunches brings about finding oneself in one's Promised Land."@en ;
