pmc:NewThoughtShinnHotelNameFlashed a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "A lead flashing into consciousness and persisting"@en, "Ein Hinweis blitzt ins Bewusstsein und bleibt"@de ;
    skos:definition "The name of a hotel flashed into the stranded woman's mind and stood out in big letters; at the hotel she met an old friend who lent her suite free for months."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 12 \"Catch Up with Your Good\", p. 225; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnCatchUpWithYourGood a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Catching up with one's good"@en, "Das eigene Gute einholen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Arriving at the good that was already prepared, by following intuition and being awake to it."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Catch up with your good\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 12 \"Catch Up with Your Good\", p. 225; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnWishingTheory a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Progress from desire: Lamarck's wishing theory"@en, "Aller Fortschritt kommt aus dem Wunsch: Lamarcks Wunschtheorie"@de ;
    skos:definition "Science is said to be returning to Lamarck: birds have wings because they wished to fly, driven by emotional wishing; fish caught the divine idea of a bird and wished themselves into birds."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"push of the emotional wish\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 12 \"Catch Up with Your Good\", p. 225; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnPowerOfThoughtWithClearVision a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Thought with clear vision as irresistible"@en, "Die unwiderstehliche Kraft des Gedankens mit klarer Sicht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Thought joined to clear vision is irresistible; many live in a fog making wrong decisions."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 12 \"Catch Up with Your Good\", p. 225; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

