pmc:NewThoughtShinnDefiniteUnmistakableLeadYieldsCatchUpWithYourGood a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Asking for a definite, unmistakable lead yields catching up with one's good"@en, "Um einen eindeutigen, unmissverständlichen Hinweis bitten: Das eigene Gute einholen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, student or acquaintance: asking for a definite, unmistakable lead was followed by catching up with one's good."@en ;
