pmc:NewThoughtShinnViolationOfIntuition a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "All suffering comes from violating intuition"@en, "Alles Leiden kommt aus der Verletzung der Intuition"@de ;
    skos:definition "Unless intuition builds the house, the builders labour in vain; Christmas shoppers returning gifts illustrate ignored leads."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnMagicPathOfIntuition fails."@en ;
