pmc:NewThoughtShinnBringingToPassThatWhichIs a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Spiritual law brings to pass what already is, crystallized by sincere desire"@en, "Das geistige Gesetz verwirklicht, was schon ist, kristallisiert durch aufrichtiges Wünschen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The good exists as an idea in Universal Mind and is crystallized outwardly by sincere desire; each should be achieving something apparently impossible."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
