    rdfs:label "Asking for guidance in whatever one does yields saving time, energy and a lifetime of misery"@en, "Bei allem, was man tut, um Führung bitten: Zeit, Kraft und ein Leben voller Elend ersparen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that asking for guidance in whatever one does brings about saving time, energy and a lifetime of misery."@en ;
