pmc:NewThoughtShinnHabitOfHunchingYieldsMagicPathOfIntuition a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Getting the habit of hunching yields intuition: the magic path"@en, "Sich das Ahnen zur Gewohnheit machen: Intuition: der magische Pfad"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that getting the habit of hunching brings about intuition: the magic path."@en ;
