pmp:NewThoughtShinnGiveGodYourUndividedAttention a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Giving God undivided attention in the face of obstacles; looking away from appearances"@en, "Gott ungeteilte Aufmerksamkeit schenken angesichts der Hindernisse; vom Anschein wegsehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Turn attention to God's invincible though invisible power, keep saying silently that his ways are ingenious, and look away from adverse appearances."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 12 \"Catch Up with Your Good\", p. 227; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnFeelingOfAssurance a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Taking a statement that gives a feeling of assurance"@en, "Eine Aussage nehmen, die ein Gefühl der Sicherheit gibt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Choose a statement that gives assurance, e.g. the long arm of God statement; Ch. 13 defines a clicking statement as one giving a feeling of security."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
