pmc:NewThoughtShinnLongArmOfGodYieldsRightnessAndJusticeAtTheExactTime a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Long-arm-of-God affirmation yields rightness and justice in a dealing, at the moment of speaking"@en, "Affirmation vom langen Arm Gottes: Richtigkeit und Gerechtigkeit in einer Verhandlung, im Moment des Sprechens"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told by the author of her own work: long-arm-of-God affirmation was followed by rightness and justice in a dealing, at the moment of speaking."@en ;
