pmc:NewThoughtShinnMagicLife a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Leading a magic life"@en, "Ein magisches Leben führen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Working out the divine design, one leads a magic life, guided and supplied at each step if one has ears to hear and eyes to see (Ch. 13)."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"magic life\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
