pmc:NewThoughtShinnHabitsOfLaziness a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Lazy habits that dull the desire to go forward defy the divine design"@en, "Träge Gewohnheiten, die den Wunsch weiterzugehen abstumpfen, widersetzen sich dem göttlichen Plan"@de ;
    skos:definition "Those asleep to their good are said to go against the divine design; a woman who spent her days in bed reading magazines, perhaps meant to write for them, let laziness dull every wish to advance."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"asleep to their good\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnDivineDesign fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
