pmc:NewThoughtShinnINowCatchUpWithMyGoodYieldsCatchUpWithYourGood a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Closing affirmation of catching up with one's good yields catching up with one's good"@en, "Schlussaffirmation: Ich hole mein Gutes nun ein, bevor ich rief, wurde ich erhört: Das eigene Gute einholen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that closing affirmation of catching up with one's good brings about catching up with one's good."@en ;
