#
# Rivers in the Desert
#

pmc:NewThoughtShinnUnconditionedAndAbsolute a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Becoming unconditioned and absolute by working with God-Power"@en, "Durch das Wirken mit Gotteskraft unbedingt und absolut werden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Working with God-power man is said to become unconditioned and absolute; this hidden power can be called on at any moment."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"God-Power\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 229; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnGodWithin a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "Infinite Intelligence = the God within"@en, "Unendliche Intelligenz = der Gott im Innern"@de ;
    skos:definition "Infinite Intelligence is identified with the God within and with the superconscious, which points out the way; contact with it makes appearances of evil evaporate."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "the God within; Invincible Power" ;
    pm:nameRole "indwelling divine intelligence identical with Infinite Intelligence and the superconscious" ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 229; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnAppearanceOfEvilEvaporates a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Appearances of evil evaporating"@en, "Verdunsten des Anscheins des Bösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "On contact with Infinite Intelligence all appearance of evil is said to evaporate, being from vain imaginings."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 229; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnCallingOnTheLaw a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Making conscious contact with the Invincible Power by one's word"@en, "Bewussten Kontakt mit der Unbesiegbaren Kraft durch das eigene Wort herstellen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Call on the Lord (read as Law) by making an affirmation of Truth; take a statement that clicks, i.e. gives a feeling of security."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"calling on the Lord or Law\"."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 229; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnCallingOnTheLawYieldsAppearanceOfEvilEvaporates a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Making conscious contact with the Invincible Power by one's word yields appearances of evil evaporating"@en, "Bewussten Kontakt mit der Unbesiegbaren Kraft durch das eigene Wort herstellen: Verdunsten des Anscheins des Bösen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text claims that making conscious contact with the Invincible Power by one's word brings about appearances of evil evaporating."@en ;
