pmc:NewThoughtShinnAdamicDream a pm:Naming ;
    rdfs:label "The Adamic Dream: Adam and Maya, the tree of illusion"@en, "Der adamische Traum: Adam und Maya, der Baum der Illusion"@de ;
    skos:definition "Adam is generic man who ate of Maya, the illusion tree, and perceived two powers, good and evil; people sleep in this dream of opposites within race thought; Christ came to wake them to one power, God."@en ;
    pm:nameForm "Adam; Maya the tree of illusion; Adamic Dream" ;
    pm:nameRole "generic man; illusion of two powers" ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 230; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnAsleepToYourGood a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Lacking any good thing means one is still asleep"@en, "Fehlt einem etwas Gutes, schläft man noch"@de ;
    skos:definition "Enslavement to ideas of lack, interference and incompletion is a sign one has not woken from the Adamic dream."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmc:NewThoughtShinnAwakeFromTheAdamicDream fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Secret Door to Success (1940), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Three, ch. 13 \"Rivers in the Desert\", p. 230; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1940 DeVorss print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnAwakeFromTheAdamicDream a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Waking from the Adamic dream of two powers"@en, "Erwachen aus dem adamischen Traum der Gegensätze"@de ;
    skos:definition "Awakening to the one power after long sleep in race thought, aided by the law of agreement."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnSecretDoorToSuccess ;
