    rdfs:label "Wilderness or desert = being out of harmony"@en, "Wüste = Disharmonie"@de ;
    skos:definition "The Bible speaks of states of consciousness: one is in the wilderness when angry, resentful, fearful or undecided; a word in a Truth meeting can open a way in it."@en ;
