pmc:NewThoughtShinnNeverUndecided a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Intuitive people never hesitate"@en, "Der intuitive Mensch ist nie unentschlossen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Given leads and hunches, such a person goes boldly ahead, sure of being on the magic path."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
