    rdfs:label "Protection from obtaining what is not in the Divine Plan"@en, "Schutz davor, zu erhalten, was nicht im Göttlichen Plan ist"@de ;
    skos:definition "Having asked for the Divine Plan, one is said to be protected from things outside it; later one is grateful not to have got the coveted thing."@en ;
