    rdfs:label "Temptation to argue with intuitive leads"@en, "Versuchung, mit intuitiven Hinweisen zu streiten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Following the reasoning mind against leads is named as a temptation, corrected by the Hand of Destiny."@en ;
