pmc:NewThoughtShinnWideAwakeToMyGoodPresupposesFindYourCruelStepMother a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Find the negative conviction before reversing it"@en, "Die negative Überzeugung finden, bevor man sie umkehrt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Locating the stepmother's tyranny precedes the repeated reversing affirmation."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnWideAwakeToMyGood ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnFindYourCruelStepMother ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
