pmc:NewThoughtShinnOpenRoadOfFulfillment a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The Open Road of Fulfillment; unhindered manifestation of the Divine Plan"@en, "Der Offene Weg der Erfüllung; ungehinderte Manifestation des Göttlichen Plans"@de ;
    skos:definition "The closing statement claims the divine plan manifests without hindrance or delay."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's term: \"Open Road of Fulfillment\"."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
